-- src:867 | Bên mua bảo hiểm.
@ref V082021 6.6 (src:865-867)
GIVEN `the claim file was complete and valid` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Company refused the benefit`        IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`6.6 — the Company must give its reasons in writing, the file complete` `the claim file was complete and valid` `and the benefit refused` `the Company refused the benefit` MEANS
    `the claim file was complete and valid` AND `the Company refused the benefit`
